    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/f0cf3060773b85ba7c0eab285214fc9d.poster.avif?t=1754523266\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/f0cf3060773b85ba7c0eab285214fc9d.webm?t=1754523266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/f0cf3060773b85ba7c0eab285214fc9d.mp4?t=1754523266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A journey to uncover the hidden kingdom of Gloomveil, a once-flourishing land of sentient insects now shrouded in the shadows of the forest.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/b800dbaa8f70238a3fc94e896e965858.webp?t=1754523266\" width=616 height=14 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/529bbb57709622131dbde99c982bea9c.webp?t=1754523266\" width=616 height=60 /></span>Explore a <strong>vast</strong>, <strong>interconnected </strong>world that doesn't revolve around you. Each corner hides <strong>secrets </strong>waiting to be uncovered. Create <strong>shortcuts </strong>and familiarize yourself with the land to stay on course</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/fc6af5d1954b95e9943f55e6f0932704.webp?t=1754523266\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Gloomveil, <strong>navigating </strong>the world isn't just a means to an end\u2014it's the <strong>essence of the gameplay</strong>. Observe the creatures around you and move through their territory with <strong>caution</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/5875a4d3b0cee58eadfc5da6c66acc07.webp?t=1754523266\" width=616 height=60 /></span>Sometimes, in moments of <strong>haste </strong>or <strong>fear</strong>, you might feel compelled to use your <strong>weapon</strong>. It\u2019s your <strong>choice</strong>, but be aware that this could lead to<strong> unforeseen consequences</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/b800dbaa8f70238a3fc94e896e965858.webp?t=1754523266\" width=616 height=14 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/b160eb9dff5d46e5a7e0d3ab8197ad99.poster.avif?t=1754523266\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/b160eb9dff5d46e5a7e0d3ab8197ad99.webm?t=1754523266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/b160eb9dff5d46e5a7e0d3ab8197ad99.mp4?t=1754523266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Vertical and Horizontal Exploration</strong>: Navigate through a world designed for both vertical and horizontal exploration. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Dynamic Day-Night Cycle</strong>: Experience a day-night cycle with events that change based on the time of day. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Flexible Playstyles</strong>: Complete the game using any playstyle\u2014every approach is viable. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Accessible Controls</strong>: Play with one hand, using keyboard-only, mouse-only, or either side of the gamepad. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Environmental Storytelling</strong>: Immerse yourself in a world where the environment tells its own story. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Optional Dialogues</strong>: Engage in dialogues only if you choose\u2014perfect for players who prefer action over conversation. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Minimal UI</strong>: Enjoy a clean, immersive experience with minimal UI and no distracting indicators. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Co-op</strong>: Play with friends in local cooperative mode.<br> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/ff986615f06b54fbcea303649a22fb68.poster.avif?t=1754523266\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/ff986615f06b54fbcea303649a22fb68.webm?t=1754523266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/ff986615f06b54fbcea303649a22fb68.mp4?t=1754523266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/b61d76f28642105662d050a7f9487e21.avif?t=1754523266\" data-has-big width=800 height=172 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/f0cf3060773b85ba7c0eab285214fc9d.poster.avif?t=1754523266\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/f0cf3060773b85ba7c0eab285214fc9d.webm?t=1754523266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/f0cf3060773b85ba7c0eab285214fc9d.mp4?t=1754523266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A journey to uncover the hidden kingdom of Gloomveil, a once-flourishing land of sentient insects now shrouded in the shadows of the forest.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/b800dbaa8f70238a3fc94e896e965858.webp?t=1754523266\" width=616 height=14 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/529bbb57709622131dbde99c982bea9c.webp?t=1754523266\" width=616 height=60 /></span>Explore a <strong>vast</strong>, <strong>interconnected </strong>world that doesn't revolve around you. Each corner hides <strong>secrets </strong>waiting to be uncovered. Create <strong>shortcuts </strong>and familiarize yourself with the land to stay on course</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/fc6af5d1954b95e9943f55e6f0932704.webp?t=1754523266\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Gloomveil, <strong>navigating </strong>the world isn't just a means to an end\u2014it's the <strong>essence of the gameplay</strong>. Observe the creatures around you and move through their territory with <strong>caution</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/5875a4d3b0cee58eadfc5da6c66acc07.webp?t=1754523266\" width=616 height=60 /></span>Sometimes, in moments of <strong>haste </strong>or <strong>fear</strong>, you might feel compelled to use your <strong>weapon</strong>. It\u2019s your <strong>choice</strong>, but be aware that this could lead to<strong> unforeseen consequences</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/b800dbaa8f70238a3fc94e896e965858.webp?t=1754523266\" width=616 height=14 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/b160eb9dff5d46e5a7e0d3ab8197ad99.poster.avif?t=1754523266\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/b160eb9dff5d46e5a7e0d3ab8197ad99.webm?t=1754523266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/b160eb9dff5d46e5a7e0d3ab8197ad99.mp4?t=1754523266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Vertical and Horizontal Exploration</strong>: Navigate through a world designed for both vertical and horizontal exploration. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Dynamic Day-Night Cycle</strong>: Experience a day-night cycle with events that change based on the time of day. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Flexible Playstyles</strong>: Complete the game using any playstyle\u2014every approach is viable. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Accessible Controls</strong>: Play with one hand, using keyboard-only, mouse-only, or either side of the gamepad. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Environmental Storytelling</strong>: Immerse yourself in a world where the environment tells its own story. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Optional Dialogues</strong>: Engage in dialogues only if you choose\u2014perfect for players who prefer action over conversation. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Minimal UI</strong>: Enjoy a clean, immersive experience with minimal UI and no distracting indicators. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Co-op</strong>: Play with friends in local cooperative mode.<br> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/ff986615f06b54fbcea303649a22fb68.poster.avif?t=1754523266\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/ff986615f06b54fbcea303649a22fb68.webm?t=1754523266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/ff986615f06b54fbcea303649a22fb68.mp4?t=1754523266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/b61d76f28642105662d050a7f9487e21.avif?t=1754523266\" data-has-big width=800 height=172 /></span></p>",
